    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Lockheed Martin Fort Worth Texas Photo by Angel DelCueto           &#xA;FP150772 Coddou  &#xA;Factory Shots for Robbin Laird  &#xA;F-35 Updates  &#xA;Fort Worth, TX Assembly Line  &#xA;02-20-2015  &#xA;&#xA; images have been approved with notes:&#xA; &#xA;Disapproved for public release:&#xA; &#xA;- FP150772-0003 - open wing center compartments&#xA;- FP150772-0006 - open out wing tip compartment&#xA;- FP150772-0015 thru 0017 - AM-1 open forward sensor compartments&#xA;- FP150772-0019 thru 0020 - BF-46 open fwd fuselage compartment areas&#xA;- FP150772-0021 - open CTOL tailhook compartment area&#xA;- FP150772-0023 - open panels under the HT area&#xA;- FP150772-0030 thru 0032 - side structural design &amp; other components of the&#xA;forward fuselage &amp; assembly are techniques&#xA; &#xA;- Remaining photos approved for release&#xA; &#xA;Should you have any further questions, please refer to this document as JSF15-303.</rdf:li>
