     <rdf:li>F-35 Updates</rdf:li>
     <rdf:li>Fort Worth</rdf:li>
     <rdf:li>TX Assembly Line</rdf:li>
     <rdf:li>02-20-2015</rdf:li>
     <rdf:li>images have been approved with notes: Disapproved for public release: - FP150772-0003 - open wing center compartments- FP150772-0006 - open out wing tip compartment- FP150772-0015 thru 0017 - AM-1 open forward sensor compartments- FP150772-0019 thru 0020 - BF-46 open fwd fuselage compartment areas- FP150772-0021 - open CTOL tailhook compartment area- FP150772-0023 - open panels under the HT area- FP150772-0030 thru 0032 - side structural design &amp; other components of theforward fuselage &amp; assembly are techniques - Remaining photos approved for release Should you have any further questions</rdf:li>
     <rdf:li>please refer to this document as JSF15-303.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Bag>
